
.                            Deep Copy Vs Shallow Copy

___________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________
   Feature      ¦             Shallow Copy                  ¦               Deep Copy
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------    

  Definition    ¦   Copies top-level properties only        ¦   Copies all nested properties

  Methods       ¦   Object.assign(), spread{...}, slice()   ¦   JSON.parse(JSON.stringify()), structuredClone(), custom recursion

  Reference     ¦   Nested object share same reference      ¦   Nested object have new reference 

  Performance   ¦   Faster                                  ¦   Slower
                                                                                                                                
  Use case      ¦   Simple objects                           ¦   Complex nested objects
___________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________
